cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Arithmetic convolution fields — reproduction packets
message: >-
  If you use a packet from this repository, cite the paper in that
  directory and this archive. Each paper directory is self-contained.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Lee
    given-names: Youngrok
    country: KR
abstract: >-
  Self-contained reproduction packets for papers on arithmetic convolution
  fields, including paper sources, exact evidence code and saved outputs, and
  packet-specific machine-readable provenance.
keywords:
  - analytic number theory
  - Moebius function
  - von Mangoldt function
  - Bombieri-Vinogradov
  - reproducibility
repository-code: https://github.com/soke91/arithmetic-convolution-fields
